# sweep: --bare --seed-root apps/post/fixtures/inbox
# Fourteen cached letters on a reader with no token: every check fails the
# same way, and the cache is what the owner reads.
wait-for A long letter
wait-for No Hermes account is on this reader yet
expect Your cached letters are still here.
expect Tea notes
clean
shot post-cached-inbox
# Older and Newer page through the list a page at a time.
tap Older
wait-for Short note 6
expect-missing A long letter
expect Page 2
tap Older
wait-for Short note 14
expect Page 3
clean
shot post-inbox-last-page
tap Older
expect Short note 14
tap Newer
wait-for Short note 6
tap Newer
wait-for A long letter
expect Page 1
# A long letter is paged, and reopening it comes back to the same page.
tap A long letter
wait-for The kettle takes its time
expect 1 of
expect Write a reply
clean
shot post-letter
tap-id next-page
wait-for 2 of
expect-missing The kettle takes its time
tap-id previous-page
wait-for The kettle takes its time
tap-id next-page
wait-for 2 of
tap-id 4294967295
wait-for Tea notes
tap A long letter
wait-for 2 of
# The place in the letter survives a restart.
restart
wait-for Tea notes
tap A long letter
wait-for 2 of
tap-id 4294967295
wait-for Tea notes
# The count beside the page number is the inbox size, kept with the cache.
expect 14 letters
